    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "1.使學生了解雅思聽力與口說測驗考試重點",
      "describe_en": "1 Help students understand the construct of the IELTS listening & speaking section."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "2.幫助學生有效率的組織所學並且將其應用在雅思聽力與口說測驗",
      "describe_en": "2 Help students organize the knowledge learned in class and apply it in the IELTS listening & speaking section."
    }
  ],
