  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "XA02101",
    "sub_id": "72792",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>\n<ul>\n\t<li>曠課 5 次即扣考 final exam.</li>\n\t<li>缺席 1 節課扣 5 分</li>\n\t<li>每週必點名, 點名時間是上課鐘響10 分鐘後, 及下課前10 分鐘</li>\n\t<li>作業允許隔週補分數 20% off; 不接收遲繳 2 遲繳作業</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Midterm: 20% (listening only, practice tests 1-3 from: https://www.ielts-writing.info/EXAM/practice_tests/</div>\n\n<div>Final: 20% (listening only, practice tests 4-6)</div>\n\n<div>Attendance: 10%</div>\n\n<div>Listening journal (x10): 25% (2.5% for each journal)</div>\n\n<div>In-class speaking self reflection (x7): 25% **</div>\n\n<div>**: you must complete all 7 reflections to get 25%</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "* 缺課12節以上含12節及請假，期中考、期末考和口頭報告有缺一個以上，學期總成績一率不及格。\n*遲交作業將不予計分(Any overdue assignment will not be accepted.)\n* 唯重大事故(開立正式證明)且經教師簽名同意後送外語中心始得申請補考。(Valid document needs to be produced. Valid documents include wedding invitations along with correctly dated photos with the bride and groom, obituary, medical notes, or police records.)\n* 請尊重智慧財產權，購買原文書。(Please purchase original textbooks, following intellectual property law.)\n* 上課請帶課本，課文和習題會在課堂上做練習。(Bring textbooks to class. The texts and exercises will be completed in class.)\n* 不得戴耳機上課",
    "course_pol_en": "Reading Journals: students are required to write 10 journals for the course. They must be hand-written, typed ones will not be accepted. \nGrading Principle: it's my principle to grade you openly and fairly. However, once your grade is finalized, I do not make changes for any individual.  \nAll the HW must be turned on time.",
    "course_rem": "I will use this ILearn to announce important information for our FRESHMAN ENGLISH(1)ELEMENTARY course. You are suggested to visit this website regularly for updated information. If you have any questions regarding the course, please contact my TAs or simply write me an email.",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。<br />\n2. Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。<br />\n3. Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n\n<div>4. 考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1. Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。</div>\n\n<div>2. Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。</div>\n\n<div>3. Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
